                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='6'>Installs: </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='6'>Total app installs according to Adjust tracking</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='6'>New Sessions: </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='6'>Total sessions coming from new users based on Google Analytics data</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='6'>aCVR: </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='6'>Acquisitions CVR = Acquisitions / (Installs + New sessions)</run>
