                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='6'>Share of performance marketing channels acquisitions. Performance marketing channels are Display, Paid Social, SEM, SEO Non brand and App Marketing.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='6'>Installs: </run>
